0:{"buildId":"iNWCfX8KG4iu7ETtWBmLh","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Fix Pre-Form Drop-Offs to Boost Inbound Lead Generation\",\"description\":\"Getting traffic but no form fills? The form is almost never the first problem. Here's how to diagnose where trust broke down before visitors ever reached the form.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-21\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-21\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/traffic-but-no-form-fills\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Form Leaks · Conversion Diagnosis"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Fix Pre-Form Drop-Offs to Boost Inbound Lead Generation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"When visitors land but don't fill out the form, the reflex is to redesign the form - more fields, fewer fields, a different layout. That's solving the wrong problem. The form is the last thing a visitor reaches. By the time they get there, they've already decided whether they trust you enough to hand over their details. That decision happens well before the form."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-traffic-but-no-form-fills&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The Form Is The Last Gate, Not The First"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Think of the conversion path as a chain: the click brings someone with a specific intent, the hero earns the right to keep them reading, the body builds the case with proof and specifics, and the form closes the argument. If the chain breaks anywhere before the form, no amount of form optimisation will recover the conversion."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"The most common form-fill failures have nothing to do with the form itself. They're failures of trust, clarity, or credibility that happened in the first 10 seconds - and the visitor who didn't fill out your form left 40 seconds before they even scrolled far enough to see it."}]]}],"$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7"]}]]}],null,"$L8"]}],"isPartial":"$@9","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lb","isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Ld","isPartial":"$@e","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":"$f"},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$a","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@12","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@13"}
